type":"paragraph","text":"個握の私服は\n重ね着せずシンプルにいこうかしらっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆるくいきたいので、ダウンにしようかしらっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーなるんかはお楽しみにっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"................\n新しい友達を作ろうと思いしゃべりかけようとおもったんですけど...私は人見知りなのでしゃべりかけられませんでした(´；ω；｀)\nなのでどうやってしゃべりかければいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私クラス替えして\nみんなと仲良くしたい\nんだけどまりかちゃんなら\nどうします？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかは周囲と仲良くなるためにどんなことしてますか？ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問だけど周囲にすぐ馴染む方法ってある？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何気なくおしゃべりに参加してみる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうすると、自然と輪が広がっていくのかも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も実は最初は人見知り。\nでも、ちょっとしたきっかけで\n話すチャンスがあるから大丈夫‼\nまずは人間観察...⁇←\n自分から参加しないと始まらないから\n一緒に頑張ろう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新学期になったんでイメチェンしたいと\n思ってるんすけど\n万理華さんはどんな格好する人が\nいいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イメチェン‼\nどんな格好でも似合ってればなんでも^^♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近まりかのこと知ったからよくわからんねんけど好きな音楽はなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャズとかゆるいロックとかがすきです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お笑い見まりか？\nお気に入りとかありまりか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お笑い見まりかっ‼\n笑ってはいけないは家族みんなで見てます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもしろいのだいすき笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから万理華ちゃんのブログコメントしてもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますxD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪ぱっつんにした事ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したことあるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆ毛より上の短い前髪にしたこともある笑\nまた短い前髪にしてみたいわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかはカップリングどれ歌ってる?\n(まだ秘密だろうけど)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndで万理華はどの曲に参加してるのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーまだ秘密"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさーん、コメントでどれくらいデレていいですか(;＿;`??\nいつもコメントは真面目なテンション\nで書いてる(つもりな)んだけど、\nちゃんとまりかに気持ち伝わってるかなー、\nと、ふと気になるときがあるでね。。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント、自由でいいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由に書いて欲しいです‼\nしっかり、伝わってるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MDだけどまりちゃん単推しでも嫉妬しない？(笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MDてなんだ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなにまだ聞いてない‼\n...単推し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浮気したら嫉妬するぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっっっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ねねころのブログがまりかのブログに\n似てきた感じがするのは気のせい？？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤どうしだから似てくるんかな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴスロリとか似合いそう(笑)\n着たことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着たことない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいなぁ、赤いリップとかして着てみたいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅうも似合いそう‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マリカに教えてもらった絵文字が\n気に入って使わせてもらってるよ!　\n:)　:D　:>　:<　:З)　　BЗ) B-) 8З) \n最後の３つ、メガネ掛けてるように見えない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わおっいーっぱい:D\n最近はデコメばっかり使ってて\nこの子たちの登場率低いねx(\nメガネたちは個人的に83)がすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この鼻とまるメガネ最強っ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかたん、君は何でこんなにも\nファッションセンスがいいの？（ワラ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわーありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分、服すごいすきやから嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新学期始まって何か変わった？ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ慣れないけど、楽しいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり「1年から来ました」で\nこいつボケてんなー...\nて印象になってるんかな..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽつーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華は占いであたったこととかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝占い見て、その夜一日を\n思い返しても占いの内容を忘れる\n...ワイルドだろう⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃんもパリコレとかそういうのテレビで見る方？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"fashionTV、録画してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッションショーとか観に行きたいけど、\nTVで観てます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近始めたこと又は始めたいことってある？\nあったら教えてほしいなっ☆kr"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近...なるべく間食しないようにしとる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整体院行きたい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子だけど万理華ちゃんのこと大好きでもいいかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子て相当嬉しいですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当、わしもJKだし、もう気軽に‼\n本当気軽に、仲良くなりたいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フィッシュネットって何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま訳すと魚の網。\n魚の網みたいにざくざく編んだ\nニットのことです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今いっぱい出てるのさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレターとかゎちゃんとべびたん\nに届いて読んでくれてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい‼\n届いています><\nありがとうございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"................"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0031.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストールだいすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、みなさんの方が1000000倍だいすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く会いたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/6105439/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}